 ## Enforcement
 
-Instances of unacceptable behaviour may be reported privately to the repository maintainers through their GitHub profiles. Please do not use public issues for sensitive reports. Maintainers will review reports and take appropriate action based on the circumstances.
+Code-of-conduct incidents may be reported privately to the repository maintainers through their GitHub profiles. **Security vulnerabilities have a separate private reporting channel:** follow [SECURITY.md](SECURITY.md) rather than using the conduct-reporting route. Do not use public issues for sensitive reports. Maintainers will review conduct reports and take appropriate action based on the circumstances.
 
 Maintainers have the right to remove, edit, or reject comments, commits, code, and other contributions that violate this Code of Conduct.
 
